See `LICENSE-CODE`.

## Third-party material

Third-party material, if any, remains subject to its own license and is not relicensed by this repository. A reference to, summary of, or link to third-party material does not transfer ownership or grant rights beyond the applicable license or law.

If a file contains an explicit license notice that conflicts with this repository-level scope, the file-specific notice controls for that file.
